{title: Helekite Clan}
{subtitle: Numbers 26:30; Joshua 17:1–2; 1 Chronicles 7:14–17}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 125}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [–] | [Bb6] [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb6] [Gm7] |
| [Cm7] [F7] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Son of Gilead, of Mac[Eb]hir's line
Descen[Cm7]dant of Manasseh divine
From Joseph's firstborn, [Bb]the branch grew
Re[Bb7/F]corded in [Eb]the geneal[Cm7]ogy
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
Among the [F7]clans counted in [Bb]Moab
[Eb]On the plains they stood in the [Bb/D]tab
Helek's [Cm7]name is written in [Bb]stone
[Eb]Within the tribe, [Dm7]he is [G7]known
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Cm7]From Helek comes the Helekite [Bb]clan
Part of Ma[Eb]nasseh, as the text [Cm7]has planned
They received their inheri[F7]tance by lot
[Bb]In the land of Ca[Eb]naan, a sacred spot
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
A [Cm7]man of war, hold[F7]ing the [Bb]land [Gm7][Cm7][F7][Bb][Gm7][Cm7]
[F7]Mac[Bb]hir received Gilead and Bas[Eb]han
The [Cm7]rest of the descendants took their [F7]share
[Bb]Sons of Abiezer, breathing [Eb]the air
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Cm7]Sons of Helek, As[F7]riel, and Shechem
[Bb]Hepher and She[Eb]mida, in the [Cm7]rhythm
Male descendants [F7]of the father's house
[Bb]Counting the people [Eb]in the dust
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Cm7]From Helek comes the [F7]Helekite clan
Part [Bb]of Manasseh, [Eb]as the text has planned
[Cm7]They received their inheri[F7]tance by lot
[Bb]In the land of Ca[Eb]naan, a sacred [Cm7]spot
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Chroni[F7]cles tell [Bb]the [Eb]story clear
Asriel bore, [Dm7]his Ara[Cm7]mean dear
Machir took a [Bb]wife, Maacah's name
[Eb]Bore a son, Peresh, [Dm7]without blame
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Cm7]Ulam's son was Bedan, it is [Bb]said
Sons of Gi[Eb]lead, firmly planted
[Cm7]Helek's clan, [F7]in history's book
[Bb]Israel's history, [Eb]in the [Cm7][F7]look
{end_of_verse}

